<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-QUEENSLAND OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-QUEENSLAND OPEN FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round</p>
<p>scores and totals in the Queensland Open golf tournament on</p>
<p>Sunday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>275 Steve Alker (New Zealand) 67 69 67 72</p>
<p>276 Greg Chalmers 65 67 72 72</p>
<p>278 Stephen Leaney 71 69 70 68, Bradley Hughes 68 70 71 69</p>
<p>279 Peter Lonard 69 70 67 73</p>
<p>280 Shane Tait 74 69 64 73, Michael Long (New Zealand)</p>
<p>67 70 69 74</p>
<p>281 Peter Senior 71 71 70 69, Steven Conran 70 69 71 71</p>
<p>283 Wayne Perske 70 73 70 70, Paul Gow 72 69 71 71, Leith</p>
<p>Wastle 69 68 74 72, Glenn Joyner 72 69 68 74</p>
